{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:42:15+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T07:42:15+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Genuit Group plc","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Building Products & Equipment","country":"United Kingdom","city":"Leeds","website":"https://www.genuitgroup.com","employees":3274,"summary":"Genuit Group plc develops and produces solutions for water, climate, and ventilation management in the construction industry in the United Kingdom, rest of Europe, and internationally. The company operates in three segments: Climate Management Solutions, Water Management Solutions, and Sustainable Building Solutions. The company offers plastic pipes and fittings; underfloor heating solutions and air-source heat pumps; magnetite filters; water testing and treatment products; MVHR systems that combine supply and extract ventilation in one system; and MRXBOX hybrid cooling system, which reduces the temperature of air entering the dwelling. It also provides roof solutions, which reduce and absorb carbon; drainage solutions for surface water flooding; bio-solar systems; stormwater management, urban greening; installation services; and Polysync, a surface water attenuation system that forecasts weather events to optimize water volumes stored in attenuation tanks for weather events caused by climate change. In addition, the company offers Polyplumb, a plumbing solution; drainage; value-added solutions; building solutions; Permavoid solution, which makes running tracks permeable and prevents flooding; Nuaire, heat recovery units; Bat Ridge Roost and Swift Nesting Brick, which provides habitable spaces for bats and birds; and compact magnetic filters. The company was formerly known as Polypipe Group plc and changed its name to Genuit Group plc in April 2021. Genuit Group plc was founded in 1980 and is headquartered in Leeds, the United Kingdom.","exchange":"LSE","currency":"GBp","financial_currency":"GBP","summary_fr":"Genuit Group plc développe et produit des solutions pour la gestion de l'eau, du climat et de la ventilation dans l'industrie de la construction au Royaume-Uni, dans le reste de l'Europe et à l'international. La société opère dans trois secteurs: les solutions de gestion du climat, les solutions de gestion de l'eau et les solutions de construction durable. La société propose des tuyaux et des raccords en plastique, des solutions de chauffage par le sol et des pompes à chaleur à air, des filtres à magnétite, des produits de test et de traitement de l'eau, des systèmes MVHR qui combinent l'approvisionnement et l'extraction de la ventilation dans un seul système et un système de refroidissement hybride MRXBOX, qui réduit la température de l'air entrant dans l'habitation."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":655398976,"shares_outstanding":252076527,"trailing_pe":20.0,"forward_pe":10.639169,"price_to_book":99.38838,"ev_to_ebitda":7.757,"ev_to_revenue":1.423,"dividend_yield":0.0493,"payout_ratio":0.96269995,"beta_yahoo":1.382},"targets":{"current_price":260.0,"mean":365.1,"median":370.0,"high":500.0,"low":273.0,"n_analysts":10,"reco_mean":1.66667,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-08-11"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":null,"ex_dividend":"2026-08-27","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.01038,"institutions_pct":0.88051003,"institutions_float_pct":0.88975,"institutions_n":113,"institutions":[],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.014099999,"shares":3547424,"value":922330240,"date":"2026-04-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0095,"shares":2395756,"value":622896560,"date":"2026-03-31","chg":0.0214},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.0064999997,"shares":1650499,"value":429129740,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"D